<p style="margin:0 0 16px">Hello,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px">Someone, hopefully you, asked to join the <%= @product.name %> waitlist with this address. To confirm your place, press the button.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px"><a href="<%= @confirm_url %>" style="display:inline-block;background:#1d1c1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600">Confirm my place</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#5d5a55;font-size:14px">The link works for <%= Rails.configuration.x.confirmation_validity.in_days.to_i %> days. If you don't confirm, your address is deleted after that and you won't hear from us again. If this wasn't you, ignore this email.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5d5a55;font-size:14px"><a href="<%= @leave_url %>" style="color:#5d5a55">Leave the list and delete my details</a> · <a href="<%= @product.privacy_url %>" style="color:#5d5a55">Privacy</a> · <a href="<%= @product.site_url %>" style="color:#5d5a55"><%= @product.name %></a></p>
